{"title":"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the minimum possible product of three different numbers of the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/6/4c698088be27b12dcfccf7c1193b831d71fcd4ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{-8,-6,-4,0,3,5,7\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/6/1a6381d7a876f3cb7f793e7e45ffb84132788c31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ {-336} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ {-280} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ {-210} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ {-192} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"462\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> selected numbers is negative, either all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers are negative or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> number is negative and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers are positive.\n</p><p>The minimum product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> negative numbers from this set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d822be67cf684079ed4d3bacc4eb1778936cb1ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-8)(-6)(-4) = -192$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"20\" />, while the minimum product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> negative number and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> positive numbers from this set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/5/c455112d4c008ac143194bef6cfaf95a8aebd68b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-8)(5)(7) = -280$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the minimum product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers from this set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/b/dcbe3c3726cb8f310938ebec060023435dc7f294.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ {-280}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 8\">2000 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2000\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"